<title>POLAND: NBP SELLS PLN 275.5 MLN 91-DAY BILLS, AVG YIELD UP.</title>
<headline>NBP SELLS PLN 275.5 MLN 91-DAY BILLS, AVG YIELD UP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 275.5 million zlotys worth of its 91-day bills on demand of 278.5 million zlotys against a 300 million zloty tender, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Their average yield rose to 22.20 percent from 22.19 percent at the last tender on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
